WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.288
Welcome to Homecare.

00:00:02.238 --> 00:00:05.788
This updated guide follows the current navigation.

00:00:05.788 --> 00:00:12.525
Start with Products, use News and updates for dated developments, and
find Target inspiration under Insights.

00:00:13.076 --> 00:00:16.264
Choose Products, then Browse competitors.

00:00:16.214 --> 00:00:21.101
Pick a retailer and narrow the catalog by search, category or brand.

00:00:21.101 --> 00:00:26.089
Open Details to check the exact product, pack and saved source
evidence.

00:00:26.089 --> 00:00:31.101
A catalog addition date is not a retailer listing date or a product
launch date.

00:00:31.668 --> 00:00:36.593
Select products for your shortlist, then open Compare selected from
Products.

00:00:36.543 --> 00:00:42.368
Review photographs, pack sizes, currencies and dated price
observations side by side.

00:00:42.368 --> 00:00:49.530
Export selected CSV saves the selected records with photo and source
links; the spreadsheet does not embed the images.

00:00:50.092 --> 00:00:53.180
News and updates now opens its own view.

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:56.617
Read each dated update and follow the source links.

00:00:56.617 --> 00:01:02.517
A newly discovered listing is new to this directory, unless there is
separate evidence of a new launch.

00:01:02.517 --> 00:01:06.104
Rechecking an old page does not make it new news.

00:01:06.668 --> 00:01:14.268
Under Insights, choose Target inspiration to review Homecare reference
products, proposed improvements and questions to validate.

00:01:14.218 --> 00:01:20.143
There is no separate White-label recommendations tab, and Brands and
factories has been removed.

00:01:20.143 --> 00:01:24.843
These ideas are research proposals, not approved assortment decisions.

00:01:25.404 --> 00:01:28.704
Return to Home whenever you need the starting point.

00:01:28.654 --> 00:01:33.904
Help and guide keeps this video, captions, a download and the
transcript together.

00:01:33.904 --> 00:01:38.966
You can continue browsing, comparing and exporting at the same
Homecare address.
